  "body": "Positioned in the sought-after Amaia Takapuna, Apartment 509 offers an excellent opportunity to secure a well-appointed 59sqm one-bedroom residence with a separate study.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern living, the apartment combines a comfortable bedroom, contemporary bathroom and dedicated study — ideal for working from home, creating a quiet retreat or simply enjoying the flexibility of additional space.\r\n\r\nThe real appeal extends beyond the apartment itself. Located on Esmonde Road, you're within easy reach of Takapuna Beach, vibrant cafés and restaurants, boutique shopping and beautiful coastal walkways. With convenient motorway and public transport connections, Auckland CBD and the wider North Shore are also easily accessible.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, professional, downsizer or investor, this is an opportunity to enjoy the convenience and lifestyle that makes Takapuna one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nA smart apartment in an exceptional location — enquire today to arrange your private viewing.",
